Title: First Light
Credit: Written by
Author: Baz Studios
Draft date: October 2026

FADE IN:

EXT. COASTAL ROAD - DAWN

The ocean is still a rumor in the dark. A lone bicycle crests the hill, its headlight tracing the white line.

MARA, 30s, stops at the overlook. She takes a folded letter from her coat.

MARA
You picked a hell of a place to say goodbye.

A car door closes behind her.

ELI
He always liked an entrance.

INT. LIGHTHOUSE - MORNING

Dust turns in a shaft of sunlight. The old lamp is silent.

Mara lays the letter on the keeper's desk. Beside it: a brass key.

MARA
How long has this been here?

ELI
Long enough.

They listen to the sea.

FADE OUT.
